<p>Gets the current event for the event script.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Event%20keyword" title="Event keyword">event</a> GetCurrentEvent(<br />);</div>
