<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Gets the current event for the event script that was just fired.
This function should only be used in the event script.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Using this function outside of the event script might result in odd behaviour as the event returned might be invalid.
</p>
